  "_doc": "Shared by BuddyNext Free and Pro (Pro's .wbcom-i18n.json points here). Every translation uses these renderings for these terms; see docs/translation-standard.md in the wbcom-i18n-ai repo. Renderings follow the vocabulary BuddyPress, bbPress and WordPress core already use in each language, so a site owner meets words they know. Change a rendering here, then run the tool with --review-all for that locale.",
